:: Flats Poppy Enter
<<set $location to "flats">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<run poppySchedule()>><<npc Poppy>><<person1>><<poppyFlatInit>><<run statusCheck("Poppy")>>
<<set $poppyFlat.kickedUntilDay to (typeof $poppyFlat.kickedUntilDay is "number" ? $poppyFlat.kickedUntilDay : -1)>>
<<if ($poppyFlat.dismissed is true or $poppyDismissalFired is 1)>>
	<<include "Flats Poppy Locked">>
<<elseif !((Number($poppySafeHouse) gte 1 or (Number($poppyromance) gte 0 and $poppySeen.includes("lake_postclaim_intro"))) and !(Number($poppyFlat.kickedUntilDay) gte Time.days) and !Time.isBloodMoon())>>
	<<if Number($poppyFlat.kickedUntilDay) gte Time.days>>
		You try to enter Poppy's flat, but the door is locked. Maybe you should try again next time.
	<<elseif Time.isBloodMoon()>>
		You knock on Poppy's door. There's no response.
	<<else>>
		The door with the poppy flower remains closed.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Back|Flats]]>><<pass 1>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 0>><</link>>
<<elseif T.poppyStatus.includes("LowPatience") and Number($poppyromance) lt 0>>
	<<if $poppyFlat.home>>
		You realise the door is locked. You knock on Poppy's door. You hear someone shuffling about inside, but no one answers.
	<<else>>
		You try to enter, but the door is locked.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Back|Flats]]>><<pass 1>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 0>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<include "Flats Poppy First Entry">>
<</if>>

:: Flats Poppy First Entry
<<if _poppyFreshEntry and $christmas is 1 and Time.monthDay is 25 and $christmas_poppy_flat_pending is 1 and $christmas_poppy_flat_done isnot 1 and Number($poppyromance) gte 0>>
	<<include "Poppy Christmas Flat Arrival">>
<<else>>

<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>><<run poppySchedule()>>
You are in Poppy's flat.
<br><br>
Soft furnishings and warm lighting give the space a gentle, warm feel. You take a breath. There's a subtle earthy and powdery scent in the air that makes you a little drowsy. There is at least one pot of poppy flowers on every windowsill.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<if Number($poppyromance) gte 0 and Number($poppySafeHouse) gte 1 and !$poppyFlat.bedroomUnlocked>>
	<<set $poppyFlat.bedroomUnlocked to true>>
	<<if $poppyFlat.bedroomUnlockedNoticeSeen isnot true>>
		<span class="gold"><i>You now have access to Poppy's bedroom.</i></span>
		<<set $poppyFlat.bedroomUnlockedNoticeSeen to true>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<poppyFlatContents>>

<</if>> /* Poppy xmas */

:: Flats Poppy Living Room
<<set $bus to "poppy_living_room">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<run poppySchedule()>>
<<if $weekly.flatBumpNoticedDay isnot Time.days>>
	<<set $weekly.flatBumpNoticedDay to Time.days>><<set $weekly.flatBumpNoticed to false>>
<</if>>
<<if Time.isBloodMoon() and !$possessed>>
	The flat feels wrong under the red moon. Poppy is nowhere to be seen, and staying here suddenly feels like a terrible idea.
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave the flat|Flats]]>><<pass 1>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 0>><</link>>
<<elseif isPregnancyEnding() and $poppyFlat.home and $poppyFlat.room is "living_room">>
	<<include "Poppy PC Birth">>
<<elseif $tiredness gte C.tiredness.max>>
	<<include "Flats Poppy Exhaustion Collapse">>
<<elseif T.poppyFlatBaileyDue>>
	<<set $daily.poppy.flatBaileySeenDay to Time.days>>
	<<include "Flats Poppy Bailey">>
<<elseif npcIsPregnant("Poppy") and npcPregnancyProgress("Poppy") gte 0.23 and !knowsAboutPregnancy("Poppy", "pc") and $poppyFlat.home and $poppyFlat.room is "living_room">>
	<<include "Poppy Self Pregnancy Reveal">>
<<elseif npcIsPregnant("Poppy") and npcPregnancyProgress("Poppy") lt 0.48 and knowsAboutPregnancy("Poppy", "pc") and !C.npc.Poppy.pregnancy.ultrasoundShown and $poppyFlat.home and $poppyFlat.room is "living_room">>
	<<include "Poppy Show Ultrasound">>
<<elseif playerAwareTheyArePregnant() and !knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Poppy") and playerBellySize() gte 7 and $poppyFlat.home and $poppyFlat.room is "living_room" and $weekly.flatBumpNoticedDay isnot Time.days>>
	<<include "Poppy Notice Bump">>
<<else>>
You are in Poppy's living room.
<br><br>
There is a glass coffee table between the couch and TV stand. The TV stand is decorated with cute little figurines. On the couch, a pillow stands out from its surroundings. It's a Frostburger pillow.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<if $poppyFlat.home>>
	<<if $poppyFlat.room is "kitchen" and $poppyFlat.meal and !$daily.poppy.flatMeals[$poppyFlat.meal]>>
		/* Poppy is cooking and player hears it from the living room */
		You hear the sound of kitchen appliances clanking. The smell of food wafts through the air. Poppy is making <<print $poppyFlat.meal>>.
		<br><br>
		<<if $poppyFlat.meal is "breakfast">>
			<<link [[Help Poppy make breakfast (0:20)|Flats Poppy Help Meal]]>><<pass 20>><</link>><br>
			<<link [[Eat breakfast (0:20)|Flats Poppy Eat Meal]]>><<pass 20>><</link>><br><br>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Help Poppy make dinner (0:20)|Flats Poppy Help Meal]]>><<pass 20>><</link>><br>
			<<link [[Eat dinner (0:20)|Flats Poppy Eat Meal]]>><<pass 20>><</link>><br><br>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $poppyFlat.room is "living_room">>
		/* Poppy is in the living room with the player */
		<<if npcIsPregnant("Poppy") and npcPregnancyProgress("Poppy") gte 0.49 and knowsAboutPregnancy("Poppy", "pc")>>
			<<include "Poppy Idle Pregnant Flat">>
		<<else>>
			<<if Time.hour gte 15 and Time.hour lt 18>>
				Poppy's sitting on the couch with <<his>> legs crossed and a book in hand.
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<rng>>
			<<if $rng lte 35 and !$poppySeen.includes("flat_lipstick_event") and !$daily.poppy.flatLipstickChecked and random(1,4) is 1>>
				<<set $daily.poppy.flatLipstickChecked to true>>
				<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Approach Poppy|Flats Poppy Lipstick Event]]>><</link>>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Approach Poppy|Flats Poppy Social]]>><<set $eventskip to 0>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		/* Poppy is home but in the bedroom/bathroom player can chill on couch */
		<<poppyicon "living_room">><<link [[Rest on the couch (0:15)|Flats Poppy Couch Rest]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	/* Poppy is not home at all */
	<<poppyicon "living_room">><<link [[Rest on the couch (0:15)|Flats Poppy Couch Rest]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<poppyicon "window">><<link [[Approach the window|Flats Poppy Window]]>><<set $poppyFlat.windowRoom to "living_room">><</link>>
<br><br>
<<poppyFlatContents>>
<</if>>

:: Flats Poppy Window
<<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>><<set $outside to 0>>
You approach the window.<br>
<<if Time.hour lt 9>>
	You can see that the street is already busy, even so early.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 18>>
	You can see pedestrians fill the pavements, but the sound of traffic dominates.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 21>>
	You can see that the sun has long since disappeared behind the towers, but the street remains busy.
<<else>>
	Voices and occasional shouting emerge from nearby buildings despite the hour.
<</if>>
<br><br>
A pot of poppies rests on the sill, their colour vivid against the glass.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<if !$daily.poppy.flatTending[$poppyFlat.windowRoom]>>
	<<poppyicon "poppy">><<link [[Tend to the poppies (0:15)|Flats Poppy Tend Poppies]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue">The poppies look well cared for.</span>
<</if>>
<br>
<<if $bus is "poppy_bedroom">><<link [[Back|Flats Poppy Bedroom]]>><</link>><<else>><<link [[Back|Flats Poppy Living Room]]>><</link>><</if>>

:: Flats Poppy Tend Poppies
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>><<run poppySchedule()>><<wearProp "red rose">>
<<set $daily.poppy.flatTending[$poppyFlat.windowRoom] to true>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>>
You tend to the poppies.
<br><br>
You carefully pull out the weeds growing around the beautiful flowers. You water the soil and sprinkle a little bit of fertilizer around the flowers. Satisfied with your work, you take a step back.
<br><br>
<<if $poppyFlat.home and $poppyFlat.room isnot "bedroom">>
	Poppy notices your work and smiles. "
	<<if currentSkillValue('tending') gte 1000>>
		You have a way with plants, don't you? I'm impressed."
		<br><br>
		You make <<printmoney 20000>><<money 20000 "flatsCleaning">>
	<<elseif currentSkillValue('tending') gte 500>>
		Not bad. Thank you for your help."
		<br><br>
		You make <<printmoney 10000>><<money 10000 "flatsCleaning">>
	<<else>>
		Hm... it could have been better, but still, thank you."
		<br><br>
		You make <<printmoney 5000>><<money 5000 "flatsCleaning">>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	When you finish, you notice a folded letter left nearby, tucked neatly where you could not have missed it.
	You blink at it. You don't remember seeing it there before.
	<br><br>
	Inside is money, along with a short note thanking you for tending to the flowers.
	<<if currentSkillValue('tending') gte 1000>>
		You gain <<printmoney 20000>><<money 20000 "flatsCleaning">>
	<<elseif currentSkillValue('tending') gte 500>>
		You gain <<printmoney 10000>><<money 10000 "flatsCleaning">>
	<<else>>
		You gain <<printmoney 5000>><<money 5000 "flatsCleaning">>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse false true>>
<<if $bus is "poppy_bedroom">><<link [[Back|Flats Poppy Bedroom]]>><<handheldon>><</link>><<else>><<link [[Back|Flats Poppy Living Room]]>><<handheldon>><</link>><</if>>

:: Flats Poppy Couch Rest
<<set $bus to "poppy_living_room">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
You rest on the couch, enjoying the tranquility of the place that the orphanage could not give.
<br><br>
<<if $pain gt 0>>
	You feel a little more at ease.
	<<lstress>><<stress -4>><<lpain>><<pain -3>><<ltiredness>><<tiredness -15>>
<<else>>
	You feel a little more at ease, but the drowsiness doesn't fade.
	<<lstress>><<stress -4>><<gtiredness>><<tiredness 15>>
<</if>>
/* Track addiction without double-applying the stat effects from the widget. */
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Back|Flats Poppy Living Room]]>><</link>>

/* ============================================================
   LI SOCIAL INTERACTION
   ============================================================ */
:: Flats Poppy Social
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $bus to "poppy_living_room">><<effects>>
<<run poppySchedule()>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>>
<<if Time.isBloodMoon() and !$possessed>>
	The flat feels wrong under the red moon. Poppy is nowhere to be seen, and staying here suddenly feels like a terrible idea.
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave the flat|Flats]]>><<pass 1>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 0>><</link>>
<<elseif !C.npc.Poppy or C.npc.Poppy.init isnot 1 or !$poppyFlat.home or $poppyFlat.room isnot "living_room">>
	<<if $eventskip is 1>>
		Poppy glances at <<his>> watch. "Oh, look at the time."
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Flats Poppy Departure]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<include "Flats Poppy Departure">>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if playerAwareTheyArePregnant()>>
		<<if C.npc.Poppy.pregnancy.test is true>>
			/* PC came back with paternity proof */
			<<procedureicon "paternity">><<link [[Show Poppy the paternity result (0:05)|Poppy Pregnancy Reveal]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<elseif !knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Poppy")>>
			/* PC has never told Poppy; show whatever PC has */
			<<if getPregnancyObject().ultrasoundDone and C.npc.Poppy.pregnancy.ultraSound is "requested">>
				/* Poppy already saw the test once and asked for proof */
				<<pregnancyicon "player">><<link [[Show Poppy the ultrasound (0:05)|Poppy Pregnancy Reveal]]>>
					<<set C.npc.Poppy.pregnancy.ultraSound to "collected">><<pass 5>>
				<</link>>
				<br>
			<<elseif getPregnancyObject().ultrasoundDone>>
				/* PC has both test and ultrasound in hand, combined reveal */
				<<pregnancyicon "player">><<link [[Show Poppy the pregnancy test and ultrasound (0:05)|Poppy Pregnancy Reveal]]>>
					<<set C.npc.Poppy.pregnancy.ultraSound to "collected">><<pass 5>>
				<</link>>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				/* PC only has the test */
				<<if !V.player.vaginaExist>>
					<<pregnancytesticon>><<link [[Show Poppy the pregnancy test (0:05)|Poppy Pregnancy Reveal Mpreg Alt]]>>
						<<pass 5>>
					<</link>>
				<<else>>
					<<pregnancytesticon>><<link [[Show Poppy the pregnancy test (0:05)|Poppy Pregnancy Reveal]]>>
						<<pass 5>>
					<</link>>
				<</if>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<poppyFlatsMenu>>
<</if>>

:: Flats Poppy Bodywriting Reaction
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Poppy")>><<set $outside to 0>>
<<if _bodywriting_exposed gte 1 and !_bodypart>><<unset _bodypart>><</if>>
<<if _bodywriting_exposed gte 1 and !$daily.poppy.bodywriting and _bodypart and Number($poppyromance) gte 0>>
	<<set $daily.poppy.bodywriting to true>><<set _poppyStatus to Array.isArray(T.poppyStatus) ? T.poppyStatus : []>>
	<<if ["Robin","Whitney","Eden","Kylar","Sydney","Avery","Alex","Black Wolf","Great Hawk","Gwylan"].includes($skin[_bodypart].special) and $skin[_bodypart].special isnot "Poppy">>
		<<if _poppyStatus.includes("LowPatience")>>
			You chat with Poppy. Poppy glares at the <<tattoo _bodypart>> on your <<bodypart _bodypart>>, clearly bothered by it. <<He>> grits <<his>> teeth and clenches <<his>> fists, as if ready to lash out at you, but the moment passes. 
			<br><br>
			Poppy rolls <<his>> eyes with a scoff and looks away.<<npcincr Poppy patience -4>><<if C.npc.Poppy.patience gt 0>><<llpatience>><<else>><<gganger>><</if>>
		<<else>>
			You chat with Poppy. Poppy narrows <<his>> eyes at the <<tattoo _bodypart>> on your <<bodypart _bodypart>>. "Why do you have someone else's name on you while you're my <<girlfriend>>?"
			<br><br>
			Poppy presses <<his>> thumb against your skin and tries to rub it off.
			<br><br>
			<<if ["marker","tattoo","brand","magic"].includes($skin[_bodypart].pen)>>
				<<He>> frowns when it doesn't come off and quickly gives up with a huff. "If only I had rubbing alcohol with me..." <<he>> grumbles.
				<<npcincr Poppy patience -4>><<if C.npc.Poppy.patience gt 0>><<llpatience>><<else>><<gganger>><</if>>
			<<else>>
				<span class="blue"><<He>> rubs at your <<tattoo _bodypart>> on your <<bodypart _bodypart>></span>,
				<<if $skin[_bodypart].pen is "pen">>
					smearing the ink before it finally comes away.
				<<else>>
					smearing the <<print $skin[_bodypart].pen>> before it finally comes away.
				<</if>>
				<br><br><<bodywriting_clear _bodypart>>
				"There. All better." <<He>> smiles triumphantly.
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif ["prostitution","rape","exhibitionism","sex"].includes($skin[_bodypart].special) or $skin[_bodypart].lewd is 1 and !_poppyStatus.includes("LowPatience")>>
		You chat with Poppy. <<He>> studies the <<tattoo _bodypart>> on your <<bodypart _bodypart>> with a faint frown. "Such vulgar things shouldn't be written on you."
		<br><br>
		Poppy presses <<his>> thumb against your skin and tries to rub it off.
		<br><br>
		<<if ["marker","tattoo","brand","magic"].includes($skin[_bodypart].pen)>>
			<<He>> frowns when it doesn't come off and quickly gives up with a huff. "If only I had rubbing alcohol with me..." <<he>> grumbles.
			<<npcincr Poppy patience -2>><<if C.npc.Poppy.patience gt 0>><<lpatience>><<else>><<ganger>><</if>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="blue"><<He>> rubs at your <<tattoo _bodypart>> on your <<bodypart _bodypart>></span> until the writing smears away.
			<<bodywriting_clear _bodypart>>
			"There, all gone now." <<He>> smiles triumphantly and kisses you on the cheek. "You're all beautiful again."
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $skin[_bodypart].pen is "tattoo" and !_poppyStatus.includes("LowPatience")>>
		You chat with Poppy. <<He>> notices the tattoo on your <<bodypart _bodypart>> and smiles. 
		<br><br>
		"That tattoo suits you. It must've been painful when you had it done, huh?" <<He>> chuckles.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>><<set $eventskip to 1>>
<<poppyFlatsMenu>>

:: Flats Poppy Pass Out
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Poppy")>><<set $outside to 0>>
Your eyelids feel heavy and your vision blurs. Poppy tilts <<his>> head, looking at you with confusion. You want to warn <<him>> about your impending black out but you are too late.
<br><br>
<span class="red">You pass out.</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Flats Poppy Wake]]>><<pass 40>><</link>>

:: Flats Poppy Wake
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>><<run statusCheck("Poppy")>>
Your eyes flutter open after your unwelcomed nap. 
<br><br>
<<if T.poppyStatus.includes("LowPatience")>>You see an impatient Poppy staring down at you. "How nice of you to just fall asleep like that." <<He>> remarks in a sarcastic tone. It seems like <<he>> wanted to say more but held <<his>> tongue instead.
<<else>>Poppy smiles down at you. "You must've been really tired huh? I'm glad that you got some well needed rest. Be sure to take care of yourself properly." <<He>> reminds you gently.<</if>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<pass 40>><<tiredness -100>>
<<poppyFlatsMenu>>

:: Flats Poppy Doze
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Poppy")>><<set $outside to 0>>
As you are chatting with Poppy, <<his>> head starts to nod and <<his>> posture slumps slightly. You take a closer look to find that <<he>> had dozed off.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Wake Poppy gently|Flats Poppy Doze Gentle]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Scare Poppy|Flats Poppy Doze Scare]]>><</link>>

:: Flats Poppy Doze Gentle
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>>
You rest a hand on Poppy's shoulder and gently shake <<him>> awake while calling <<his>> name. 
<br><br>
When <<he>> awoke, <<his>> cheeks are flushed with embarrassment.
<br><br>
"Sorry for dozing off like that in the middle of the conversation, that was rude of me. I should be more mindful of my sleep schedule..." <<He>> laughs bashfully.
<<npcincr Poppy love 1>><<glove>><<poppyOpiumPulse>><<set $eventskip to 1>>
<<poppyFlatsMenu>>

:: Flats Poppy Doze Scare
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>>
You stand up and loom over <<him>> from behind. You ready yourself and slap both your hands on <<his>> shoulders, shouting <<his>> name loudly.
<br><br>
Poppy's ears pin back as <<he>> lets out a loud scream similar to a fox. You are sure that <<his>> scream can be heard from all four corners of the forest.
<br><br>
When Poppy realised it was you, <<he>> let out a shaky exhale and pressed a hand to <<his>> chest. "Oh, it's just you... don't scare me like that. I thought the hunter caught me..." Poppy's expression has gone sour after your little prank.
<<npcincr Poppy patience -4>><<if C.npc.Poppy.patience gt 0>><<llpatience>><<else>><<gganger>><</if>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<if $awarelevel lt 5 and !$poppySeen.includes("poppy_tf_revealed")>>
	<<link [[Ask Poppy about the scream|Flats Poppy Doze Ask]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Back|Flats Poppy Social]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>

:: Flats Poppy Doze Ask
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>>
"Why does your scream sound like that?” you ask. "It's very foxlike."
<br><br>
Poppy pouts, unwilling to answer at first. "Isn't it a bit obvious? Come on now, <span class="blue">clear your vision</span>." <<He>> covers your eyes with <<his>> hand.
<br><br>
"<span class="navy">See what you're meant to see, what you want to see</span>."
<<poppyOpiumPulse>><<if !$poppySeen.includes("poppy_tf_revealed")>><<set $poppySeen.push("poppy_tf_revealed")>><</if>>
<<link [[Next|Flats Poppy Doze Ask 2]]>><</link>>

:: Flats Poppy Doze Ask 2
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>>
You blink a few times when Poppy moves <<his>> hand away. You see a pair of fox ears on <<him>> as well as a floating halo that has been shattered. A fluffy fox tail is suddenly resting on your lap. You also see a pair of ink black wings that are folded neatly behind <<him>>.
<br><br>
"You're a... fallen fox?" you ask, your expression one of bewilderment.
<br><br>
Poppy grins at you. "<span class="green">There we go</span>. Don't you think that's less straining on your eyes?" <<His>> tail wags proudly.
<<if !$poppySeen.includes("poppy_tf_revealed")>><<set $poppySeen.push("poppy_tf_revealed")>><</if>><<poppyOpiumPulse>><<set $eventskip to 1>>
<<poppyFlatsMenu>>

:: Flats Poppy Departure
<<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>><<set $outside to 0>><<run statusCheck("Poppy")>>
<<if T.poppyStatus.includes("LowPatience")>>
    <<if T.poppy_location is "flatKitchen">>
        Poppy stood up without a word and headed to the kitchen, not sparing you a glance.
    <<else>>
        Poppy stood up wordlessly and walked out the front door without looking back.
    <</if>>
<<elseif T.poppy_location is "flatKitchen">>
    <<if Number($poppyromance) gte 0>>
        <<if T.poppy_location_message is "breakfast">>
            "I should get breakfast started." Poppy closes <<his>> book and stands, stretching with a warm smile. "I'll call you when it's ready, my jewel."
        <<else>>
            "Time to start on dinner." Poppy closes <<his>> book and stands. <<He>> leans down and presses a kiss to your forehead. "I'll call you when it's ready, my jewel."
        <</if>>
    <<else>>
        <<if T.poppy_location_message is "breakfast">>
            "I should get breakfast started." Poppy stands up and stretches. "I'll let you know when it's ready."
        <<else>>
            "Time to start on dinner." Poppy closes <<his>> book and stands. "I'll let you know when it's ready."
        <</if>>
    <</if>>
<<elseif Number($poppyromance) gte 0>>
    "What a shame, time flies by whenever I'm with you." Poppy stands up with a sigh. "Thanks for keeping me company, my jewel."
    <br><br>
    <<He>> kisses you on the cheek.
    <br><br>
    "I'll be home later. Bye bye now." <<He>> whispers into your ear before leaving with a giggle.<<arousal 200>><<garousal>>
<<else>>
    "I think it's time for me to go." Poppy stands up with a grunt. "Thanks for hanging around, I enjoyed your company. I'll be home later. Bye bye now!"
    <br><br>
    <<He>> waves to you and skips off into the front door.
<</if>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Back to living room|Flats Poppy Living Room]]>><</link>>

:: Flats Poppy Chat
<<set $location to "flats">><<set $bus to "poppy_living_room">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>><<run statusCheck("Poppy")>>
<<if T.poppyStatus.includes("LowPatience")>>
	You try to converse with Poppy, but <<he>> doesn't look at you. <<He>> gives you little to no response, <<if $awarelevel gte 5>>only the occasional ear twitch or tail flick.<</if>>
<<elseif (Number(C.npc.Poppy.love) || 0) gte 80 and !$poppySeen.includes("poppy_tf_revealed") and $awarelevel lt 5>>
	The more time you spend with Poppy, the more you feel like there's something just out of reach.
	<br><br>
	"There's something different about you," you say. "But I just can't put my finger on it."
	<br><br>
