<<set $poppySeen.push("flat_lipstick_event")>>
You are in the living room. You see Poppy sitting on the couch with a tube of lipstick and mirror in hand. You also see multiple tubes of lipstick on top of the coffee table.
<br><br>
"What are you up to?" you ask as you sit down beside Poppy.
<br><br>
"Testing out some new lipsticks I bought." <<He>> smiles at you. "I couldn't decide which one I wanted or which fit me better so I just bought them all." <<He>> shrugs and applies lipstick onto <<his>> lips.
<br><br>
"Now that you're here, how about we do an experiment?" Poppy turns to you with a sly grin. "Let's see which lipstick is kiss proof." <<He>> pulls you closer by the chin and kisses you on the lips.<<garousal>><<arousal 300>>
<br><br>
When Poppy pulls away, <<he>> looks at you and pouts. "What a shame, it's not kiss proof. I liked this shade." <<He>> wipes <<his>> lips off with a tissue and starts applying another tube of lipstick. The process went on for awhile. Apply, kiss, wipe and repeat.
<br><br>
By the time Poppy is done, you are a blushing mess with your face and neck covered in lipstick marks. "At least there's some that are kiss proof. My money didn't go to waste after all. I didn't bore you with my experiment, did I?" <<He>> asks in a coy tone.
<br><br>
You shake your head furiously. "Not at all, I enjoyed it," you say with a lopsided grin.
<br><br>
Poppy chuckles. "Good <<girl>>." <<He>> kisses you on the lips before releasing you.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>><<set $eventskip to 1>>
<<poppyFlatsMenu>>

