:: Flats Poppy Kitchen
<<set $location to "flats">><<set $bus to "poppy_kitchen">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
<<if $tiredness gte C.tiredness.max>>
	<<include "Flats Poppy Exhaustion Collapse">>
<<elseif T.poppyFlatBaileyDue>>
	<<set $daily.poppy.flatBaileySeenDay to Time.days>>
	<<include "Flats Poppy Bailey">>
<<else>>
You are in Poppy's kitchen. The walls are lined with wooden wall cabinets and countertops that give off a cottage feeling. There are various kitchen appliances on the countertops along with seasonings neatly placed on a spice rack.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<if $poppyFlat.home and $poppyFlat.room is "kitchen" and $poppyFlat.meal and !$daily.poppy.flatMeals[$poppyFlat.meal]>>
	Poppy is at the counter, working on <<print $poppyFlat.meal>>.
	<br>
	<<if $poppyFlat.meal is "breakfast">>
		<<link [[Help Poppy make breakfast (0:20)|Flats Poppy Help Meal]]>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>><<pass 20>><</link>><br>
		<<link [[Eat breakfast (0:20)|Flats Poppy Eat Meal]]>><<pass 20>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>><</link>><br><br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Help Poppy make dinner (0:20)|Flats Poppy Help Meal]]>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>><<pass 20>><</link>><br>
		<<link [[Eat dinner (0:20)|Flats Poppy Eat Meal]]>><<pass 20>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>><</link>><br><br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<allowLewdIngredients>><<kitchenDisplay>>
<<if $cookbook is true>>
	<<set _baseTime to Math.max(180 - (6 * Math.round($housekeeping / 50)), 10)>>
	<<set _timeString to getTimeString(_baseTime)>>
	<br><br>
	<<housekeeping_exam_select>>
	<<if $chosen_recipe isnot "none">>
		<span class="gold">You can teach yourself a recipe from your cookbook here.</span> You flip open the book and land on a recipe for <<print $chosen_recipe.replace(/_/g," ")>>.<br><br>
		<<link [["Learn something new (" + _timeString + ")"|Kitchen Self Teach]]>><<pass _baseTime>><<housekeeping 1 1000>><</link>><<ghousekeeping 1000>>
	<<else>>
		There's no more recipes you can learn.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<poppyFlatContents>>
<</if>>

