:: Flats Poppy Eat Meal
<<set $location to "flats">><<set $bus to "poppy_kitchen">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
You sit at the kitchen table as Poppy bustles around the kitchen. 
<br><br>
<<He>> turns from the counter with two plates and places one in front of you. A <<if $poppyFlat.meal is "breakfast">>full English breakfast<<else>>lasagne<</if>> that makes your mouth water upon the sight of it. It smells good too.<<ltrauma>><<trauma -5>>
