<<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
You compliment the food. "It's really good," you say. "Better than the restaurants in town."
<br><br>
Poppy tilts <<his>> head with a smile. "Thanks," <<he>> <<if $poppyFlat.meal is "breakfast">>pops a piece of cut sausage<<else>>shovels a spoonful of lasagne<</if>> into <<his>> mouth. "I got all my ingredients from a reliable source. Their produce is always fresh."
<<npcincr Poppy love 1>><<glove>><<npcincr Poppy patience 1>><<if C.npc.Poppy.patience gte 0>><<gpatience>><<else>><<langer>><</if>><br><br>
The two of you had a nice meal.
<<set $daily.poppy.flatMeals[$poppyFlat.meal] to true>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>  
<<link [[Back|Flats Poppy Kitchen]]>><</link>>

