	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Flats]]>><<pass 1>><<handheldon>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 0>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
		Just as you were about to push open the door, it swings open, startling you.
	<<else>>
		You learned a thing or two about skulduggery. The door swings open, startling you.
	<</if>>
