	You swallow, trying to come up with an excuse but your words get stuck in your throat from how intently <<hes>> staring you down. It somehow reminds you of Bailey.<<gstress>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	"I think you should leave. If you want to skulk around, I suggest you do it elsewhere. Such behaviour is not welcome in my home." Poppy nudges <<his>> head in the direction of the front door. Knowing that there is no room for negotiation, you could only hang your head and walk out in shame.
	<br><br><<set $poppyFlat.kickedUntilDay to Time.days + 7>>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Flats]]>><<pass 1>><<handheldon>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 0>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Flats Poppy Bedroom
<<endevent>><<npc Poppy>><<person1>><<run poppySchedule()>>
<<set $location to "flats">><<set $bus to "poppy_bedroom">><<effects>><<set $outside to 0>><<run statusCheck("Poppy")>>
<<poppyFlatInit>>
<<if Time.isBloodMoon() and !$possessed>>
	The flat feels wrong under the red moon. Poppy is nowhere to be seen, and staying here suddenly feels like a terrible idea.
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave the flat|Flats]]>><<pass 1>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 0>><</link>>
<<elseif $tiredness gte C.tiredness.max>>
	<<include "Flats Poppy Exhaustion Collapse">>
<<elseif !$poppyFlat.bedroomUnlocked and (typeof $poppyromance is "number" ? $poppyromance : -1)>>
	<<include "Flats Poppy Bedroom Locked">>
<<elseif T.poppyFlatBaileyDue>>
	<<set $daily.poppy.flatBaileySeenDay to Time.days>>
	<<include "Flats Poppy Bailey">>
<<else>>
You are in Poppy's bedroom. 
<br><br>
A lavish vanity sits near the window. Beside it is a wire grid board that's filled with photos and notes. There's a big wardrobe on one wall and a bookshelf filled with stuffed plushies on the opposite. In between them, a double bed is perfectly made with various pillows arranged neatly on it. The extremely soft duvet seems to call out to you to lay on it. A giant fox plushie sits at the corner of the room.
<br><br>
There is a thermometer outside the window. It reads <span class="teal"><<print Weather.toSelectedString(Weather.temperature, 0)>></span>.<<print setup.WeatherDescriptions.extremeTemperature()>>
<br><br>
/* Poppy presence, shown before action links */
<<if $poppyFlat.home>>
	<<if Time.hour is 1 and $poppyFlat.room is "bedroom">>
		Tired from a long and productive day, Poppy climbs into bed sleepily and snuggles under the covers.
		<br><br>
	<<elseif Time.hour gt 1 and Time.hour lt 6 and $poppyFlat.room is "bedroom">>
		Poppy sleeps soundly in bed.
		<br><br>
	<<elseif Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lt 7 and !$daily.poppy.flatMeals[$poppyFlat.meal]>>
		Poppy stretches and yawns as <<he>> gets up from bed. <<if !(T.poppyStatus and T.poppyStatus.includes("LowPatience"))>>"Morning <<if $player.gender_appearance is "m">>handsome<<else>>beautiful<</if>>. <span class="green">I'll go make breakfast</span>..."<</if>> 
		<br><<He>> stalks to the kitchen.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

/* Deferred state flags from other passages */
<<if $unbind is 1>>
	<<unset $unbind>>
	<<if $possessed>>
		You stare down at your bindings. You pull, and they fall apart, unable to hold against you. <<unbind>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<span class="green">You rub your bindings against the bed frame.</span> It takes some effort, but eventually the material yields, freeing your limbs.
		<br>
